      <CitationRef elementRef="citation__10562426_" />
    </DataNode>
    <DataNode elementId="AT4G19710-MONOMER" textLabel="AT4G19710-MONOMER" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="AT4G19710-MONOMER" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="750" centerY="535" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis&lt;/i&gt; gene &lt;i&gt;AK-HSDH2&lt;/i&gt; was overexpressed in &lt;i&gt;E. coli&lt;/i&gt;, purified to homogeneity, and characterized |CITS:[16216875]|. The enzyme was shown to be bifunctional and to have both aspartate kinase and homoserine dehydrogenase activities |CITS:[16216875]|.</Comment>
